 | Passes | Stepover | 3 |
 | Passes | Stock to leave | 0 |
 | Passes | Optimal load (% of D) | about 14.6 (used by Adaptive and Offset rings) |
+| Passes | Pass starts at | Auto (Inside, Outside); used by Waterline and Offset rings |
